{
 "description": "DEV-2977 B3.5 + DEV-3024 \u2014 audited candidate resume access, LINK-ONLY: returns the exact five-variant projection {url, expiresAt, availability, reason, provenanceStatus, provenance} with a fresh 600-second signed URL when AVAILABLE, plus storage-observed provenance when available, or a truthful MISSING / LEGACY_EXTERNAL_REFERENCE_REDACTED / STORAGE_OBJECT_UNAVAILABLE state. structuredContent IS that raw closed response object \u2014 no wrapper. Requires BOTH candidate_dossier:read AND candidate_documents:read, a claimed account, the default-off candidate-dossier agent surface, and canonical-admin (OpenTrain staff) authority for the exact proposal \u2014 resume FILES are admin-only: employers and their agents are refused with a typed RESUME_FILES_ADMIN_ONLY 403, candidate self with a typed SELF_ACCESS_NOT_SUPPORTED denial. Every admitted access is audited append-only server-side BEFORE the URL is disclosed. This tool never follows redirects and never fetches file bytes; download with your own HTTP client from the returned signed URL. The response is runtime-validated and provenance is bound to the requested proposal \u2014 a mismatched upstream body is a typed failure telling you to upgrade this package, never forwarded data.",
 "execution": {
  "taskSupport": "forbidden"
 },
